abstract: >-
  Data and scripts for a density functional study of the benzotriazolium picrate ion pair (CCDC 835950): the
  N4–H4N···O1 ion pair optimised at B3LYP/6-311++G(d,p) in the gas phase and in IEF-PCM water, with Hessians,
  wavefunctions, Multiwfn analyses, run logs, the register of every number in the associated article and the
  scripts that rebuild it. Also the calculations of the revision of the article (November 2026): a second crystal
  form (P2₁/n, COD 2230422) treated with the same protocol; the location of the LUMO against the permittivity,
  ΔSCF states and Hirshfeld/CM5 charges; B3LYP-D3(BJ) minima; proton-transfer and inter-ion torsion scans with
  other functionals, DF-MP2, a CCSD(T) correction and proton vibrational levels; and TD-DFT excited states, each job
  with its record, logs, scripts and environment lock.
